     "text": "**Short answer:** This is a strong offer compared with the market. Whether it beats your current job depends on numbers I don't have yet, mainly what you'd give up by leaving Varrowby. Either way, you should negotiate. They recruited you and you're happy where you are, so you have the most leverage a candidate can have, and there's little downside to asking.\n\n## 1. How the offer compares with the market\n\n| Component | Annual value (target) |\n|---|---|\n| Base | $235,000 |\n| Bonus (20% target) | $47,000 |\n| RSUs ($1.08M \u00f7 4) | $270,000 |\n| **Total per year** | **~$552,000** |\n\nFor comparison, Levels.fyi puts ",
